#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:11 details-investments.docbook:17
#, no-c-format
msgid "Investments"
msgstr "Investicije"

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:14
#, no-c-format
msgid "Investments in &kappname;"
msgstr "Investicije u &kappname;"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:19
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Investments are instruments for investing money that are traded on a market. "
"Stocks, bonds, and mutual funds are the most common investments; so they are "
"the ones supported most directly. Futures, commodities, options, and more "
"complex derivatives are also sometimes used, but &kappname; has no special "
"functionality for them. As long as they behave like a stock or a bond, they "
"can be tracked easily."
msgstr ""
"Investicije su instrumenti za investiranje novca kojima se trguje na berzi. "
"Dionice, obveznice i uzajamni fondovi su najčešće investicije; pa su one "
"podržane najdirektnije.Budućnosti, roba, opcije i kompleksniji izvodi se "
"ponekad koriste, ali &kappname; nema posebnu funkcionalnost za njih. Dokle "
"god se ponašaju kao dionica ili obveznica, mogu se lagano pratiti."

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid "Base Currency"
msgstr "Bazna valuta"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:31
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each investment has a Base Currency. This is the currency in which it is "
"traded. When a price quote is entered for an investment, the currency of the "
"value given is always its base currency. A stock on the NYSE (New York Stock "
"Exchange) would be in US dollars, and one on an Australian market would be "
"in Australian dollars."
msgstr ""
"Svaka investicija ima baznu valutu. To je valuta u kojoj se trguje "
"investicijom. Kada se navod cijene unese za investiciju, valuta njene "
"vrijednosti je uvijek bazna valuta. Dionica na NYSE(berzi New York-a) bi "
"bila u američkim dolarima, a ona na australijskoj berzi bi bila u "
"australijskim dolarima."

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:41
#, no-c-format
msgid "Investment Accounts"
msgstr "Investicioni računi"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:42
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Investment Accounts hold a collection of investments. An Investment account "
"contains transactions, such as buys and sells, of those investments. All "
"transactions in an Investment account must relate to a specific investment. "
"There is no separate <quote>cash balance</quote> in an investment account. "
"For that, you need a Brokerage Account."
msgstr ""
"Investicioni računi čuvaju kolekciju investicija. Investicioni račun sadrži "
"transakcije, kao što su kupovina i prodaja tih investicija. Sve transakcije "
"u investicionom računu moraju biti povezane sa specifičnom investicijom. Ne "
"postoji odvojeni <quote>bilans novca</quote> u investicionom računu. Za to "
"vam treba brokerski račun."

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid "Brokerage Accounts"
msgstr "Brokerski računi"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An investment account often has an associated Brokerage Account. This is "
"also sometimes referred to as a <quote>Cash Account</quote>. Investment "
"accounts cannot contain cash transactions, like a transfer from your bank. "
"When a stock is sold, the proceeds are typically placed in the Brokerage "
"Account."
msgstr ""
"Investicioni račun često ima povezan brokerski račun. Ovo se ponekad naziva "
"i <quote>račun za novac</quote>. Investicioni računi ne mogu sadržavati "
"transakcije novca, kao što je transfer iz vaše banke. Kada je dionica "
"prodana, sredstva su većinom smještena u brokerski račun."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you create an Investment Account, you have the option of creating an "
"associated Brokerage Account with it."
msgstr ""
"Kada napravite investicioni račun, imate opciju za kreiranje povezanog "
"brokerskog računa."

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating an Investment Account"
msgstr "Kreiranje investicionog računa"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The first step on the path to working with investments is to create an "
"account to hold your investments. Choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Account</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>New account...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> to begin the "
"process of adding a new account. Create an account as usual, making sure to "
"choose <quote>Investment</quote> as the type of account."
msgstr ""
"Prvi korak u radu sa investicijama je kreiranje računa koji će čuvati vaše "
"investicije. Odaberite <menuchoice><guimenu>Account</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>New account...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> kako biste započeli "
"proces dodavanja novog računa. Napravite račun kao i obično, ali budite da "
"ste odabrali <quote>Investment</quote> kao tip računa."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To work with the new investment account, navigate to the "
"<guibutton>Investments</guibutton> view, and choose the account you have "
"just created from the <guilabel>Select Account</guilabel> dropdown box."
msgstr ""
"Kako biste radili sa novim investicionim računom, otiđite na "
"<guibutton>Investicijski</guibutton> pregled i odaberite račun koji ste "
"upravo kreirali iz <guilabel>Odaberi račun</guilabel> padajućeg okvira."

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding Investments to Your Account"
msgstr "Dodavanje investicija u vaš račun"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To add individual Investments to your Investment Account, navigate to the "
"<guibutton>Investments</guibutton> view, select the <guibutton>Equities</"
"guibutton> tab, and choose the account where the investment is held from the "
"<guilabel>Select Account</guilabel> drop-down box."
msgstr ""
"Kako biste dodali nove investicije u vaš investicioni račun, otiđite na "
"<guibutton>Investicije</guibutton> pregled, odaberite <guibutton>Akcije</"
"guibutton> tab i odaberite račun u kojem je sadržana investicija iz "
"<guilabel>Izaberi račun</guilabel> opadajućeg prostora."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: details-investments.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Investment View, Equities Tab</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Pogled investicija, kartica akcija</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: details-investments.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Investment View, Equities Tab</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Pregled investicija, tab akcija</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Right-click the mouse in the empty space in the view. This brings up the "
"<guimenu>Investment Options</guimenu> context menu. Choose <guimenuitem>New "
"investment...</guimenuitem> from this menu. This launches the <guilabel>New "
"Investment Wizard</guilabel> which you use to create your new Investment."
msgstr ""
"Desni klik mišem na prazni prostor u pregledu. Ovo će otvoriti "
"<guimenu>Opcije investicija</guimenu> kontekstni meni. Odaberite "
"<guimenuitem>Nova investicija...</guimenuitem> iz ovog menija. Ovo će "
"pokrenuti <guilabel>Čarobnjak nive investicije</guilabel> koji će vam pomoći "
"pri kreiranju nove investicije."

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid "New Investment Wizard"
msgstr "Čarobnjak za novu investiciju"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The first thing you'll be asked to enter is the type of investment, whether "
"it's a stock, bond, etc."
msgstr ""
"Prva stvar za koju ćete biti upitani je tip investicije, da li je dionica, "
"obveznica, itd."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:125
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Next, the investment details page is presented. The following information is "
"entered on this page:"
msgstr ""
"Zatim će se pojaviti stranica sa detaljima investicije. Sljedeće informacije "
"se moraju unijeti na ovoj stranici:"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Trading Symbol. The ticker symbol used to identify the investment on "
"whatever market it trades. &kappname; requires a trading symbol for all "
"investments; however some investments do not have symbols. In this case, you "
"will need to make up a symbol for it."
msgstr ""
"Simbol razmjene. Simbol koji se koristi za identifikaciju investicije na "
"bilo kojoj berzi. &kappname; zahtijeva da sve investicije imaju svoj simbol; "
"ipak neke investicije nemaju simbol. U ovom slučaju morate odabrati simbol "
"za investiciju."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:137
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Full name. The friendly, readable name of the investment you're creating, "
"&eg;, <quote>Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.</quote> This name is also referred "
"to as the security."
msgstr ""
"Puno ime. Prijateljsko, čitljivo ime investicije koju pravite, &eg;, "
"<quote>Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.</quote> Ovo ime se ponekad naziva i "
"sigurnost."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:142
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Fraction. The degree of precision to which your holdings are measured. For "
"example, in the US most mutual funds measure holdings to three decimal "
"places, so you would enter 1000 in this field. Stocks are often measured to "
"only whole units, so you could enter 1 for a stock like this."
msgstr ""
"Frakcija. Stepen preciznosti do kojeg će se mjeriti vrijednost vaših "
"svojina. Npr., u Americi većina uzajamnih fondova mjeri do tri decimalna "
"mjesta, pa biste ukoliko to želite ovdje, unijeli 1000 u polje. Dionice se "
"većinom mjere kao cijele jedinice, pa biste za dionice unijeli 1 u ovo polje."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:149
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Trading market. Where the stock trades. This is an optional field which is "
"provided for your convenience. This information is not used anywhere else in "
"&kappname;."
msgstr ""
"Berza. Mjesto gdje se trguje dionicama. Ovo je opcionalno polje koje je "
"pruženo kao pogodnost za vas. Ova informacija se ne koristi nigdje drugo u "
"&kappname;."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:154
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Identification. An optional field to enter additional identification "
"information you might like to keep track of. Again, this information is not "
"used anywhere else."
msgstr ""
"Identifikacija. Opcionalno polje u koje se mogu unijeti dodatne "
"identifikacijske informacije koje vi želite. Opet, ove informacije se nigdje "
"drugo ne koriste."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:159
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Trading currency. The underlying currency in which this investment trades on "
"its market."
msgstr "Valuta trgovanja. Valuta pod kojom se trguje investicijom na berzi."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:163
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Price entry. Choose whether the price will be entered as an individual "
"price, or as the total for all shares."
msgstr ""
"Unos cijene. Odaberite da li će se cijena unijeti kao individualna cijena "
"ili kao ukupna cijena svih akcija."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:168
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are using Online Quotes, ensure that the symbol exactly matches the "
"symbol used by your quote source. Yahoo covers most of the world's markets, "
"and requires a suffix on the end of symbols outside the US. For example, "
"Rubicon Limited on the New Zealand market should be entered as <quote>RBC."
"NZ</quote>."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko koristite Online navode, osigurajte da simbol tačno odgovara simbolu "
"korištenom od strane izvora vašeg navoda. Yahoo pokriva većinu svjetskog "
"tržišta, i zahtijeva sufiks na kraju simbola van Amerike. Npr., Rubicon "
"Limited na Novom Zelandu bi trebao biti unesen kao <quote>RBC.NZ</quote>."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:176
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Finally, you're presented with the Online Update screen. This is where you "
"tell &kappname; how you would like to update the prices of your investment. "
"The following items are set here:"
msgstr ""
"Na kraju će vam biti predstavljenoa strana Online ažuriranja. Ovo je mjesto "
"na kojem govorite &kappname; kako želite da ažurirate cijene vaših "
"investicija. Sljedeće stavke se ovdje postavljaju:"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:184
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use Finance::Quote. This is an option for GnuCash users who are used to this "
"style of quotes. Most users can leave this unchecked."
msgstr ""
"Upotreba Finansije::Navod. Ovo je opcija za GnuCash korisnike koji su "
"navikli na ovaj stil navoda. Većina korisnika može ovo polje ostaviti "
"neobilježenim."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:191
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Online Source. The online source you'd like to use for this particular "
"investment. The most common choice is <quote>Yahoo</quote>. Try that first, "
"and if the investment cannot be found using this source, then experiment "
"with the others."
msgstr ""
"Online izvori. Online izvori koje biste htjeli koristiti za određenu "
"investiciju. Najčešći izbor je <quote>Yahoo</quote>. Probajte to prvo, a "
"ukoliko investicija ne može biti pronađena pomoću ovog izvora, onda "
"eksperimentišite sa ostalim."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:200
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Factor. A multiplier that should be applied to quotes retrieved for this "
"investment. This is most commonly needed for UK stocks where the price "
"quoted is in pence (1/100), and the stock is denominated in pounds. In this "
"case, enter 0,01 for the Factor."
msgstr ""
"Faktor. Multiplikator koji bi se trebao odnositi na navode preuzete za ovu "
"investiciju. Ovo je najčešće potrebno za UK dionice gdje je cijena navedenu "
"u penijima(1/100) a dionice su određene u funtama. U ovom slučaju unesite "
"0,01 kao faktor."

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:212
#, no-c-format
msgid "Editing an Investment"
msgstr "Editovanje investicije"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:214
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Equities</guilabel> tab of the Investments view window lists "
"your current holdings in this account, along with their symbol, value, "
"quantity, and price. Right-click the mouse on any of the investments to "
"bring up the <guimenu>Investment Options</guimenu> context menu, where you "
"have the option to add, edit, or delete individual investments from this "
"account. Also, you can update the price of your investments here either "
"manually or via their online source. In addition, it is possible to close an "
"empty account, or to reopen a closed account."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Equities</guilabel> tab prozora za pregled investicija izlistava "
"tekuću imovinu za ovaj račun, zajedno sa njihovim simbolima, vrijednostima, "
"količinom i cijenom.Desni klik na bilo koju od investicija da bi se pojavio "
"<guimenu>Opcije investicija</guimenu> kontekstni meni, gdje imate opciju da "
"dodate, uređujete ili obrišete individualnu investiciju iz ovog računa. "
"Također možete ažurirati cijene svojih investicija ovdje ručno ili pomoću "
"njihovog mrežnog izvora. Dodatno, moguće je zatvoriti prazan račun ili "
"ponovo otvoriti zatvoren račun."

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:227
#, no-c-format
msgid "Investment Transactions"
msgstr "Investicijske transakcije"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: details-investments.docbook:231
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Investment Transaction Form</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Formular investicijske transakcije</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: details-investments.docbook:237
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Investment Transaction Form</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Forma investicijskih transakcija</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:243
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Investment transactions are entered and edited in the <link linkend="
"\"details.ledgers\">ledger</link> view, as with other kinds of accounts. "
"However, the fields are different, and vary depending on the investment "
"transaction type or activity. Investment transactions have some additional "
"elements:"
msgstr ""
"Investicijske transakcije se unose i edituju u  <link linkend=\"details."
"ledgers\">ledger</link> pregledu kao i sa ostalim vrstama računa. Ipak, "
"polja su drugačija i variraju u ovisnosti o tipu ili aktivnosti "
"investicijske transakcije. Investicijske transakcije imaju neke dodatne "
"elemente:"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:252
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Activity</para>"
msgstr "<para>Aktivnost</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:253
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Security</para>"
msgstr "<para>Sigurnost</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:254
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Account</para>"
msgstr "<para>Račun</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:255
#, no-c-format
msgid "Shares, Price, &amp; Total Amount"
msgstr "Akcije, cijene, &amp; ukupni iznos"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:256
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Fees</para>"
msgstr "<para>Naknade</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:257
#, no-c-format
msgid "Interest category"
msgstr "Kategorija kamata"

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:261
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Activity</title>"
msgstr "<title>Aktivnost</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:262
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Activity for an investment transaction describes what action is "
"happening to the stock. The following activities are supported:"
msgstr ""
"Aktivnost investicijske transakcije opisuje koja akcija se izvršava nad "
"dionicom. Sljedeće aktivnosti su podržane:"

#. Tag: term
#: details-investments.docbook:269
#, no-c-format
msgid "Buy/Sell"
msgstr "Kupi/Prodaj"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:271
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use to record purchases or sales of individual investments. This action "
"requires an account to transfer the funds from/to."
msgstr ""
"Koriste se radi snimanja kupovine ili prodaje individualnih investicija. Ova "
"akcija zahtijeva račun za transfer novčanih sredstava."

#. Tag: term
#: details-investments.docbook:279
#, no-c-format
msgid "Dividend/Yield"
msgstr "Dividenda/Prinos"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:281
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Also known as a <quote>Cash Dividend</quote>, this action is used for when "
"you receive an interest or dividend disbursement from your investment. This "
"action requires an account to transfer the funds from/to."
msgstr ""
"Također poznato kao <quote>Gotovinska dividenda</quote>, ova akcija se "
"koristi kada dobijete interes ili isplatu dividende od svoje investicije. "
"Ova akcija zahtijeva račun za transfer novčanih sredstava."

#. Tag: term
#: details-investments.docbook:291
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reinvest Dividend"
msgstr "Dividenda reinvesticije"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:293
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Reinvest Dividend. This is a dividend where the proceeds are re-invested "
"back into the investment."
msgstr ""
"Dividenda reinvesticije. Ovo je dividenda u kojoj se prihodi ponoco "
"investiraju u investiciju."

#. Tag: term
#: details-investments.docbook:301
#, no-c-format
msgid "Add/Remove Shares"
msgstr "Dodaj/Ukloni akcije"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:303
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A simple increase or decrease in your balance. This should be used very "
"rarely, because it's uncommon for shares to just show up in your account (or "
"disappear) unless it's a purchase or a sale."
msgstr ""
"Jednostavno povećanje ili smanjenje bilansa. Ovo bi se trebalo rijetko "
"koristiti zato što nije uobičajeno da se akcije samo pojave u vašem računu "
"(ili nestanu) osim ukoliko je došlo do kupovine ili prodaje."

#. Tag: term
#: details-investments.docbook:312
#, no-c-format
msgid "Split Shares"
msgstr "Podjieljene akcije"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:314
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Used when the stock is split. Enter the ratio of the split in the "
"<quote>Split Ratio</quote> field. For example, in a 3:2 split, enter 1.5"
msgstr ""
"Koriste se kada je akcija podijeljena. Unosite odnos podjele u <quote>Split "
"Ratio</quote> polje. Npr., u 3:2 podjeli, unesite 1.5"

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:325
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Security</title>"
msgstr "<title>Sigurnost</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:326
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each investment transaction must be associated with an individual security, "
"which is here just another name for an investment. Choose the investment "
"name when adding or editing a transaction. The symbol will be displayed when "
"viewing it."
msgstr ""
"Svaka investiciona transakcija mora biti povezana sa individualnom "
"sigurnošću, koja je ovdje samo još jedno ime za investiciju. Odaberite ime "
"investicije prilikom dodavanja ili editovanja transakcije. Simbol će se "
"prikazati prilikom pregledanja istog."

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:335
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Account</title>"
msgstr "<title>Račun</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:336
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For any transactions which generate or require money, you must enter the "
"account where the money is transferred to/from. If your investment account "
"has an associated brokerage account, it's usually best to transfer the funds "
"there. This applies to funds for purchase or sale of the investment, as well "
"as for fees paid or interest or dividends earned."
msgstr ""
"Za sve transakcije koje generišu ili zahtijevaju novac, morate unijeti račun "
"na/sa kojeg se novac prenosi. Ukoliko vaš investicioni račun ima povezan "
"brokerski račun, često je bolje da novčana sredstva prebacite na/sa njega. "
"Ovo se odnosi na novčana sredstva za prodaju ili kupovinu investicije kao i "
"za naknade plaćene za kamate ili zarađene dividende."

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:346
#, no-c-format
msgid "Shares, Price &amp; Total Amount"
msgstr "Akcije, cijena &amp; ukupni iznos"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:347
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For buy, sell, and cash dividend transactions, the number of shares, the "
"price per share, and the total amount of the transaction must be "
"established. You can enter any two of these, and &kappname; will calculate "
"the third. It's usually best to enter just the total amount and the number "
"of shares, because these are the known facts of the transaction. The price "
"per share can be calculated from these."
msgstr ""
"Za prodaju, kupovinu i transakciju dividendi, broj akcija, cijene po akciji "
"i ukupnan iznos transakcije mora biti unesen. Možete unijeti bilo koje dvoje "
"od navedenih i &kappname; če izračunati treće. Često je najbolje da unesete "
"ukupni iznos i broj dionica, pošto su to poznate informacije transakcije. "
"Cijena po akciji će se izračunati iz ovih."

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:358
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Fees</title>"
msgstr "<title>Naknade</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:359
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With many investment transactions you can include the fees (or commission) "
"you paid the broker. If you enter a category for the fee, then a field will "
"be shown to the right where you can enter the amount of the fee. If you need "
"to enter more than one fee for the transaction, you can use the <link "
"linkend=\"details.ledgers.split\">Split Transactions</link> feature. In this "
"case, when you complete entering all the splits, the total amount of the "
"fees will be shown to the right."
msgstr ""
"Sa puno investicionih transakcija možete uključiti naknade koje ste platili "
"brokeru. Ukoliko unesete kategoriju za naknadu, onda će se pojaviti polje na "
"desnoj strani gdje možete unijeti iznos naknade. Ukoliko morate unijeti više "
"od jedne naknade za transakciju, možete upotrijebiti <link linkend=\"details."
"ledgers.split\">Split Transactions</link> opciju. U ovom slučaju, kada "
"završite sa unosom svih dijelova, ukupni iznos naknada će ce prikazati na "
"desnoj strani."

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:371
#, no-c-format
msgid "Interest"
msgstr "Kamata"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:372
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is how you enter an interest or dividend payment from an investment. As "
"with fees, if you enter a category, then a field will be shown to the right "
"where you can enter the amount. You can also use the split transaction "
"feature, if required."
msgstr ""
"Ovako unosite kamatu ili dividendnu isplatu iz investicije. Kao i sa "
"naknadama, ukoliko unesete kategoriju, desno će se pojaviti polje da se "
"unese iznos. Također možete koristitiopciju podjele transakcije, ukoliko je "
"potrebno."

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:383
#, no-c-format
msgid "Working With Foreign Investments"
msgstr "Rad sa stranim investicijama"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:385
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kappname; supports multiple currencies and investments, and you may want to "
"combine the two. However, doing so requires extra care. As noted above, when "
"you added an investment, you had to specify its trading currency. This might "
"not be the same as your base currency, and it also might not be the same as "
"the account in which you hold the stock or the account where you transfer "
"your funds to/from for buys/sells."
msgstr ""
"&kappname; podržava više valuta i investicija, i možda zaželite "
"iskombinovati to dvoje. Ipak, potrebna pažnja je potrebna za to. Kao što je "
"navedeno iznad, kada dodate investiciju, morate navesti njenu valutu za "
"trgovanje. Ovo možda neće biti isto kao i vaša bazna valuta i možda neće "
"biti ista kao ona u računu u kojem držite svoje akcije ili u računu u kojem "
"vršite transfere novčanih sredstava za kupovinu/prodaju."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:394
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Consider a hypothetical case. Your base currency is USD. You have an "
"investment account in EUR, and a brokerage account also in EUR. In that "
"account, you hold shares of TietoEnator, which is traded in SEK."
msgstr ""
"Uzmite u obzir hipotetički slučaj. Vaša bazna valuta je američki dolar. "
"Imate investicijski račun u eurima i brokerski račun također u eurima. U tom "
"računu držite akcije TietoEnatora kojima se trguje u SEK."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:400
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you enter a buy transaction on this investment, use SEK as the "
"currency. So if you buy 100 shares at a price of SEK 248.00, for a total of "
"SEK 24,800.00, enter these values in the transaction."
msgstr ""
"Kada unesete transakciju kupovanja za ovu investiciju, upotrijebite SEk kao "
"valutu, Tako ako kupite 100 akcija po cijeni SEK 248.00, ukupno za SEK "
"24,800.00, unesite ove vrijednosti u transakciju."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: details-investments.docbook:408
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Currency Warning</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Currency Warning</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: details-investments.docbook:414
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Currency Warning</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Upozorenje za valutu</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:420
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you choose the brokerage account to fund the transfer, you'll be warned "
"that it's in a different currency."
msgstr ""
"Kada odaberete brokerski račun za transfer novčanih sredstava, bićete "
"upozoreni da je njegova valuta drugačija."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: details-investments.docbook:427
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Exchange Rate Editor</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Uređivač kursa</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: details-investments.docbook:433
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Exchange Rate Editor</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Editor kursa</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:439
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you finish the transaction, you will be prompted for a price update to "
"the investment account's currency, in this case, SEK -> EUR. Review the "
"documentation on <link linkend=\"details.currencies.prices\">Entering Prices "
"Manually</link> for more information on the price dialog."
msgstr ""
"Kada završite transakciju, bićete upitani za ažuriranje cijene za valutu "
"investicionog računa, u ovom slučaju, SEK -> EUR. Pregledajte dokumentaciju "
"na <link linkend=\"details.currencies.prices\">Entering Prices Manually</"
"link> za više informacija o dijalogu cijene."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:446
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you then switch over to the brokerage account, you will see the "
"transaction as EUR 2,254.54, assuming an exchange rate is 11.0000 SEK / EUR."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko se potom prebacite na brokerski račun, vidjećete transakciju kao EUR "
"2,254.54, pretpostavljajući da je kurs 11.0000 SEK / EUR."

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:453
#, no-c-format
msgid "Updating Prices"
msgstr "Ažuriranje cijena"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:454
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are two ways of updating the prices for your investments. You can "
"either enter the new price manually or have &kappname; fetch it from the web."
msgstr ""
"Postoje dva načina za ažuriranje cijena za vašu investiciju. Možete ili "
"unijeti cijenu ručno ili je može &kappname; dobaviti sa interneta."

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:461
#, no-c-format
msgid "Manual Price Updates"
msgstr "Ručna ažuriranja cijena"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:462
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can enter prices for your investments using the same <link linkend="
"\"details.currencies.prices\">Price Editor</link> as used for currencies."
msgstr ""
"Možete unijeti cijene za svoje investicije upotrebom istog <link linkend="
"\"details.currencies.prices\">Price Editor</link> kao i za valute."

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:470
#, no-c-format
msgid "Online Price Quotes"
msgstr "Online navodi cijena"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:471
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kappname; has the ability to download the latest prices for your "
"investments and currencies via the web."
msgstr ""
"&kappname; ima mogućnost da downloaduje najnovije cijene za vaše investicije "
"i valute pomoću interneta."

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:477
#, no-c-format
msgid "How Online Quotes Work"
msgstr "Kako online navodi rade"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:478
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At your request, &kappname; will fetch a page from the web that contains the "
"latest price for each item. By default, prices are fetched from <ulink url="
"\"http://finance.yahoo.com\">finance.yahoo.com</ulink>, and are subject to "
"the terms and conditions of that site."
msgstr ""
"Po vašem zahtjevu, &kappname; če dobaviti stranicu sa interneta koja sadrži "
"najnovije cijene za svaku stavku. Kao što je unaprijed definisano, cijene se "
"dobavljaju sa <ulink url=\"http://finance.yahoo.com\">finance.yahoo.com</"
"ulink> i u skladu su sa uvjetima te stranice."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:485
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The online quote lookup uses the investment's trading symbol to find the "
"price. Therefore, it's important to set the symbol correctly. Yahoo supports "
"stocks from most major world markets, so it's usually just a matter of "
"finding the correct symbol. For example, TietoEnator trades on the Stockholm "
"Stock Exchange market, and its Yahoo symbol is TIEN.ST."
msgstr ""
"Pretraživač online navoda koristi simbol trgovanja investicije da bi "
"pronašao cijene. Zato je potrebno da se simbol postavi korektno. Yahoo "
"podržava dionice sa većine glavnih svjetskih tržišta, pa je često samo "
"pitanje pronalaska pravog simbola. Npr., TietoEnator trguje na Stockholm "
"Stock Exchange tržištu i njegov Yahoo simbol je TIEN.ST."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:493
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To find the trading symbol for a security supported by Yahoo, use the "
"<quote>Symbol Lookup</quote> feature at <ulink url=\"http://finance.yahoo.com"
"\">finance.yahoo.com</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Da biste pronašli simbol pomoću kojeg se trguje podržan od Yahoo-a, "
"koristite <quote>Symbol Lookup</quote> opciju na <ulink url=\"http://finance."
"yahoo.com\">finance.yahoo.com</ulink>."

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:500
#, no-c-format
msgid "Assigning a Quote Source"
msgstr "Dodjela izvora navoda"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:502
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In order to get online price quotes, you first have to enable it for each "
"investment or currency you want updated, by setting a <quote>Online Quote "
"Source</quote>. This is the name of the service from which the quote should "
"be fetched. &kappname; ships with several sources to choose from. Yahoo is "
"the recommended default source, and should work for most investments and all "
"currencies."
msgstr ""
"Da biste dobili navode online cijena, prvo to morate omogućiti za svaku "
"investiciju ili valutu za koju želite ažuriranje, pomoću postavljanja "
"<quote>Online Quote Source</quote>. Ovo je ime servisa sa kojeg bi se navod "
"trebao dobaviti. &kappname; vam donosi nekoliko izbora između kojih možete "
"birati. Yahoo je preporučeni unaprijed definisani izvor i trebao bi raditi "
"za većinu investicija i za sve valute."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:511
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To assign a quote source to an investment, navigate to the investment "
"summary view for the account in which the security is held. Edit the "
"security by right-clicking it and selecting <guimenuitem>Edit Investment ..."
"</guimenuitem>. In the Investment Detail Wizard, click <guibutton>Next</"
"guibutton> twice, for the Online Update section. In the Online source "
"dropdown box, select the online source."
msgstr ""
"Da biste dodijelili izvor navoda investiciji, otiđite na sumarni pregled "
"investicija za račun u kojem se nalazi sigurnost. Editujte sigurnost desnim "
"klikom na nju i odabirom <guimenuitem>Edit Investment ...</guimenuitem>. U "
"čarobnjaku detalja investicije, kliknite na <guibutton>Next</guibutton> dva "
"puta, za sekciju online ažuriranja. U opadajućem prostori online izvora, "
"odaberite jedan online izvor."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:520
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Versions of &kappname; starting with 0.9 contain support for the Finance::"
"Quote package for obtaining online quotes. This is intended primarily as a "
"convenience for those users converting from the GnuCash finance package, "
"which uses it as its native method. If you do select this option, you should "
"see a different list of sources, those supported by Finance::Quote. If the "
"list is empty, it suggests that the package is not properly installed. See "
"their web site at <ulink url=\"http://finance-quote.sourceforge.net\"> "
"http://finance-quote.sourceforge.net</ulink> for more information."
msgstr ""
"Verzije &kappname; počevši od 0.9 sadrže podršku za Finansije::Navod paket "
"za dobivanje online navoda. Ovo je primarno namijenjeno kao pogodnost za one "
"korisnike koji konvertuju iz GnuCash finansijskog paketa koji ovo koristi "
"kao urođenu metodu. Ukoliko odaberete ovu opciju, treali biste vidjeti "
"različitu listu izvora, one podržane od strane Finansija::Navod. Ukoliko je "
"lista prazna, vjerovatno paket nije pravilno instaliran. Pogledajte njihovu "
"internet stranicu na <ulink url=\"http://finance-quote.sourceforge.net\"> "
"http://finance-quote.sourceforge.net</ulink> za više informacija."

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:534
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adjusting a quote"
msgstr "Podešavanje navoda"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:536
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Some online sources do not report the price in a base quantity (&eg;, EUR) "
"but in a fraction (&eg;, Cent). Using this information as price will produce "
"wrong values for your investments."
msgstr ""
"Neki online izvori ne prijavljuju cijenu u baznoj količini (&eg;, EUR) već u "
"frakciji (&eg;, Cent). Upotreba ove informacije kao cijene će proizvesti "
"pogrešne vrijednosti za vaše investicije."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:542
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this is the case for your online source, you can use the "
"<guilabel>Factor</guilabel> field to enter an adjusting factor. For the "
"above mentioned example the factor would be 0.01."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko je ovo slulčaj sa vašim online izvorom, možete upotrijebiti "
"<guilabel>Factor</guilabel> polje da unesete podešavajući faktor. Za gore "
"navedeni primjer, on bi bio 0.01."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:548
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Factor</guilabel> field is only available if a "
"<guibutton>Quote Source</guibutton> has been selected."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Faktor</guilabel> polje je omogućeno samo ako je <guibutton>Izvor "
"navoda</guibutton> selektirano."

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:555
#, no-c-format
msgid "Fetching Quotes"
msgstr "Dobavljanje navoda"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:557
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Typically, you will update the prices for all your investments and "
"currencies at once. Choose the <menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Update Stock and Currency Prices...</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> menu option to bring up the online price quotes dialog. Press "
"<guibutton>Update All</guibutton> to fetch quotes for all investments and "
"currencies in your &kappname; file."
msgstr ""
"Najčešće ćete ažurirati cijene za sve svoje investicije i valute odjednom. "
"Odaberite <menuchoice><guimenu>Alati</guimenu><guimenuitem>Ažuriraj cijene "
"dionica i valuta...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> opciju menija da bi se "
"prikazao dijalog za online navode cijena. Pritisnite <guibutton>Ažuriraj "
"sve</guibutton> kako biste dobili navode za sve investicije i valute u "
"svojoj &kappname; datoteci."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: details-investments.docbook:567
#, no-c-format
msgid "Update Stock and Currency Prices"
msgstr "Ažuriraj cijene dionica i valuta"

#. Tag: phrase
#: details-investments.docbook:573
#, no-c-format
msgid "Online Stock and Currency Price Update"
msgstr "Online ažuriranje cijena dionica i valuta"

#. Tag: title
#: details-investments.docbook:581
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding or Editing Quote Sources"
msgstr "Dodavanje ili editovanje izvora navoda"

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:583
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Adding or editing quote sources is not recommended for anyone but the most "
"technical user. You should feel comfortable reading HTML and writing complex "
"regular expressions. If this doesn't sound like you, we recommend writing to "
"the developer's list if none of the quote sources work for you. Ideally, "
"please point us to a web page where these quotes can be obtained."
msgstr ""
"Dodavanje ili editovanje izvora navoda nije preporučeno za bilo koga osim za "
"tehničke korisnike. Trebate se osjećati ugodno čitajući HTML i pišući "
"kompleksne regularne izraze. Ukoliko vas ovo ne opisuje, preporučujemo da se "
"obratite listi developera ukoliko vam nijedan od izvora navoda ne odgovara. "
"Idealno, molimo vas da nas uputite na stranicu sa koje se ovi navodi mogu "
"dobiti."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:591
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you do feel up to the challenge, here's how it works. The quote sources "
"are contained in the settings dialog. Choose <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &kappname;</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. From "
"there, choose the <guilabel>Online Quotes</guilabel> section. You can choose "
"an existing source to edit, or create a new one. When you are done with your "
"changes, be sure to press the <guibutton>Update</guibutton> button before "
"exiting the dialog. Your changes are not saved by default."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko midlite da ste dorasli izazovu, ovako to funkcioniše. Izvori navoda "
"su sadržani u dijalogu postavki. Odaberite <menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Konfiguriši &kappname;</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. "
"Zatim odaberite <guilabel>Dionice na mreži</guilabel> sekciju. Možete "
"odabrati postojeći izvor za editovanje ili napraviti novi. Kada ste završili "
"sa svojim promjenama, obavezno pritisnite <guibutton>Ažuriraj</guibutton> "
"dugme prije izlaska iz dijaloga. Nije unaprijed definisano da vaše promjene "
"budu sačuvane."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:602
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The first thing to worry about in an online quote source is the URL. This is "
"the page that is fetched from the web. You will see a %1 in all sources, and "
"a %2 in currency sources. For investments, %1 is replaced by the trading "
"symbol. For currencies, %1 is replaced by the From currency, and %2 is "
"replaced by the To currency. This URL is then fetched, all HTML tags are "
"removed, and that stripped file is then sent to the page parser."
msgstr ""
"Prva stvar oko koje treba brinuti u izvoru online navoda je URL. Ovo je "
"stranica koja se dobavlja sa interneta. Vidjećete %1 u svim izvorima i %2 u "
"izvorima valuta. Za investicije, %1 je zamijenjeno sa simbolom trgovanja. Za "
"valute, %1 je zamijenjeno sa From valutom, a %2 je zamijenjeno sa To "
"valutom. Ovaj Url se zatim dobavlja, sve HTML oznake se uklanjaju i tako "
"ogoljena datoteka se šalje parseru stranice."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:611
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Note that the URL can also be a file: URL, which the quote fetcher takes to "
"mean an executable script. It will pass any command-line arguments to it "
"that you have specified, and feed the stdout to the page parser. For "
"example, you might have a script called getquote.sh that contains custom "
"quote logic, taking the symbol as a single parameter. Your URL would be "
"<quote>file:/path/to/getquote.sh %1</quote>."
msgstr ""
"Imajte na umu da i URL može biti datoteka: URL, koji dobavljač navoda shvata "
"kao izvršnu skriptu. Proslijediće sve argumente komandne linije koje vi "
"specificirate i \"nahraniće\" stdout parsera stranice. Npr., možete imati "
"skriptu nazvanu getquote.sh koja sadrži logiku navoda, uzimajući simbol kao "
"jedini parametar. Vaš URL bi bio <quote>file:/path/to/getquote.sh %1</quote>."

#. Tag: para
#: details-investments.docbook:620
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The page parser looks for a symbol, a date, and a price. Regular expressions "
"tell it how to extract those items from the page. Please review the "
"documentation for the <ulink url=\"http://qt-project.org/doc/qt-4.8/qregexp."
"html#1\">QRegExp class</ulink> for the exact makeup of the regular "
"expressions. There should be exactly one capture expression, surrounded by "
"parentheses, in each regexp. The date format further tells the date parser "
"the order of year, month, and day. This date format should always be in the "
"form \"%x %x %x\". where x is y, m, or d. The date parser is very smart. "
"<quote>%m %d %y</quote> will parse <quote>December 31st, 2005</quote> as "
"easily as <quote>12/31/05</quote>. Two digit years are interpreted as being "
"in the range of 1950-2049."
msgstr ""
"Parser stranice traži simbol, datum i cijenu. Regularni izrazi mu govore "
"kako da ekstraktuje navedene stavke sa stranice. Molimo da pregledate "
"dokumentaciju sa <ulink url=\"http://qt-project.org/doc/qt-4.8/qregexp."
"html#1\">QRegExp class</ulink> za tačan makeup regularnih izraza. Trebao bi "
"biti tačno jedan izraz, okružen zagradama, u svakom regexp. Format datuma "
"zatim govori parseru redoslijed fodine, mjeseca i dana. Ovaj format datuma "
"bi uvijek trebao biti u formi \"%x %x %x\". gdje je x y,m ili d. Parser "
"datuma je veoma pametan. <quote>%m %d %y</quote> će lako raščlaniti "
"<quote>December 31st, 2005</quote> kao <quote>12/31/05</quote>. "
"Dvoznamenkaste godine se tumače kao godine između 1950 i 2049 godine."

